      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Henry Stephens & Sons erected 75 worker houses, two mills, and a depot in 1881, employing nearly a thousand loggers in the late 1880s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://thumbwind.com/2026/02/15/history-of-st-helen-michigan/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town’s Veterans Memorial honors local soldiers, adding a quiet tribute to St. Helen’s community spirit.",
